[00:00.00]Prologue -方大同（Khalil Fong ）
[00:08.00]
[00:14.241]Hey yo~
[00:16.51]This is my first cd
{"这是我的首张专辑"}
[00:18.611]and I want to thank you for listening.
{"感谢你们的聆听"}
[00:23.41]I hope you enjoy when you hear.
{"希望这些旋律能打动你"}
[00:25.421]The songs are about life and love,
{"歌曲讲述生活与爱情"}
[00:29.921]About all the good thing the bad thing
{"关于美好与遗憾"}
[00:33.791]The things that could be better,
{"关于未臻完美"}
[00:36.101]The things that change us,
{"关于改变我们的瞬间"}
[00:38.101]The things that make us who we are,
{"关于塑造自我的经历"}
[00:40.531]And may be the person we want to become.
{"也关于我们想成为的模样"}
